 "title": "10- to 16-bit resolver-to-digital converter with reference oscillator",
 "meta": [
  "Analog Devices · 센서 · 10~16비트 가변 분해능 레졸버-디지털 변환기(RDC), 여자 발진기 내장",
  "원본: <a href=\"https://www.analog.com/media/en/technical-documentation/data-sheets/ad2s1210.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">데이터시트 PDF</a> · <a href=\"https://www.analog.com/AD2S1210\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">제품 페이지</a> · <a href=\"https://octopart.com/search?q=AD2S1210\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">부품 검색 (Octopart)</a> · 문서 Rev. B"
